          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "omega-ruby",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/25/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Hariyama a l’air un peu enrobé, mais c’est en fait une montagne de muscles. Si ce Pokémon se raidit et contracte ses muscles, son corps devient dur comme de la pierre.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "alpha-sapphire",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/26/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Hariyama’s thick body may appear fat, but it is actually a hunk of solid muscle. If this Pokémon bears down and tightens all its muscles, its body becomes as hard as a rock.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "alpha-sapphire",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/26/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "肥った　体は　筋肉の　塊。 ぐぐっと　全身に　力を　込めると 筋肉は　岩と　同じ　硬さになるぞ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "alpha-sapphire",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/26/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Malgré leur force spectaculaire, les vieux Hariyama préfèrent délaisser le combat au profit de l’entraînement des jeunes Makuhita.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It is known for its fantastic strength, but as it grows older, it focuses more on training Makuhita.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "怪力で　知られるが　年老いると 戦うことを　やめ　マクノシタに 稽古を　つけるように　なるのだ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Sa force herculéenne lui permet de renverser un camion d’une seule main. Les Hariyama aiment s’adonner à des concours de force pure.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "They love to compare their freakish strength— strength enough to send a truck flying with a single slap.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "張り手　一発で　トラックを ふっ飛ばすほどの　怪力で 力比べが　大好き。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Bien qu’il aime les rapports de force, c’est aussi un cœur tendre qui sait respecter et féliciter ses adversaires pour leur combativité.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Although they enjoy comparing their strength, they’re also kind. They value etiquette, praising opponents they battle.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "力比べが　好きだが　優しさも あわせもち　戦った　相手を ねぎらうなど　礼儀を　重んじる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Les Hariyama les plus forts ne sont pas forcément les plus grands. Les petits gabarits aussi ont plus d’un tour dans leur sac.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Hariyama that are big and fat aren’t necessarily strong. There are some small ones that move nimbly and use moves skillfully.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "太って　大きな　ハリテヤマが 強いとは　限らない。　小柄でも 身軽で　技に　長けたものもいる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
